    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Very Rare (Requires Attunement by a Druid or Warlock)</em></p><p>Scenes of heroes are cast in relief on the iron sides of this Tiny pot.</p><p>You can use the cauldron as a Spellcasting Focus for your spells, and it serves as a suitable component for the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplScrying000]{Scrying} spell.</p><p><strong>Brew Potion.</strong> When you finish a Long Rest, you can use the cauldron to make a @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.dmgGreaterPotion]{Potion of Healing (Greater)}, which takes 1 minute. The potion lasts 24 hours, after which it loses its magic if it hasn’t been drunk.</p><p><strong>Raise Dead.</strong> As a Magic action, you can make the cauldron grow large enough for a Medium creature to crouch inside. You can return it to its normal size as a Magic action, harmlessly pushing anything that no longer fits inside into the nearest unoccupied space.</p><p>If you place the corpse of a Humanoid in the cauldron and cover it with 200 pounds of salt (costing 10 GP) for at least 8 hours, the salt is consumed and the creature returns to life as if by @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRaiseDead0]{Raise Dead} at the next dawn. Once used, this property can’t be used again for 7 days.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-sD17FDSu14kdR66w\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Pour <em>Brew Potion</em>, ajoutez la potion depuis le lien ci-dessus. <em>Raise Dead</em> dépense son utilisation : rendez-la à la main au bout de 7 jours.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
